{"id":"c89910355a420355","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hornterm.md","title":"Horn and pure Horn terms","display":"df-hornterm — Horn and pure Horn terms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hornterm","aliases":["27-df-hornterm"],"display":"df-hornterm — Horn and pure Horn terms","depends_on":["[[27-df-litset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hornterm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hornterm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hornterm — Horn and pure Horn terms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i(a)=a_i\">\\(x_i(a)=a_i\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i\">\\(\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\">\\(T_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n:|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\cap\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|\\le1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n:|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\cap\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n:|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\cap\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|\\le1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n:|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\cap\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Definition 6.1，印刷页 270，PDF 第 294 页（从 1 计数）。 Horn 项至多有一个负文字；pure Horn 项恰有一个。已核对定义及其空项边界：空项属于前者，不属于后者。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x_i(a)=a_i$, $\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i$ for $i\\in[n]$, $a\\in\\mathbb B^n$; $\\mathrm{Lit}_n$, $\\mathrm{Term}_n$, $T_L$ and $\\mathrm{Lits}$ are as in [[27-df-litset]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"x_i(a)=a_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x_i(a)=1-a_i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n:|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\cap\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|\\le1\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n:|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\cap\\{\\bar x_i:i\\in[n]\\}|=1\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornterm]]."},{"id":"8c66adeeb535366b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornterm]]."},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hornterm|df-hornterm — Horn and pure Horn terms]]"},{"id":"cd4ceead6b210901","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined 